<title>SINGAPORE: Next WTO ministerial meeting to be held in Geneva.</title>
<headline>Next WTO ministerial meeting to be held in Geneva.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The next World Trade Organisation (WTO) ministerial conference will be held in Geneva in 1998 at a date yet to be fixed, Singapore's Trade Minister Yeo Cheow Tong announced on Friday.</p>
<p>The inaugural ministerial conference of the WTO was held this week in Singapore.</p>
<p>-- WTO newsroom 65 337-4453</p>
</text>
